OL,3,GNEWSAVolunteers wanted for UK's deepest
OL,4,Acanal lock
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity is looking for volunteers to
OL,7,Foperate the deepest canal lock in the
OL,8,FUK, 30 years after it was opened, or to
OL,9,Ftake a scenic cycle ride to help
OL,10,Fprevent water shortages.
OL,12,FTuel Lane Lock in Sowerby Bridge lowers
OL,13,Fand raises boats almost 20ft (6m) and
OL,14,Fwas opened in May 1996 as part of the
OL,15,FRochdale Canal restoration project.
OL,17,FNow the Canal & River Trust is seeking
OL,18,Fvolunteer lock keepers to allow the
OL,19,F"unique" piece of engineering to be
OL,20,Fused more often.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
